\n\nStacked on #1168 (`feature/stock-batch-demo`). Only this Transfers composition is added; no backend, permissions, migrations or existing assertion changes. All parent mutation handlers and payloads are unchanged. This is a bounded Stock follow-on, not full demo parity or a new transfer policy.\n\nValidation: 32 focused tests, full frontend 2221/2221, full types/lint/format and production build passed; final copy/target follow-up rebuilt with scoped lint/format passing. Six rendered component regressions independently reviewed. Actual synthetic browser flow created/approved/dispatched two requests, preserved receipt drafts while switching, received one shortage and one full delivery, denied receiver self-resolution and resolved the shortage through an independent Finance actor. Structural proof has exactly two dispatches of2 and receipts of1+2. Final390/1440 light/dark captures have no overflow/JS errors and owned controls meet44/36px. Backend suite was not locally repeated for this template-only slice; exact-head CI remains required.\n\nEvidence: `/workspace/kpone-validation/stock-transfers/` includes frozen patch, manifest, review, logs and browser evidence. Independent final review is recorded there. Draft only; no merge in this task.\n","created_at":"2026-11-26T18:11:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:11:02Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1176/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1176/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/issues/1176/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/statuses/6d1606e3ec402c6583dcbd04c79df5bf2f45cbc7","h